Subject: [PATCH] Identify the patched VEXXHOST chart and operator version

The chart is based on upstream 0.27.1, but deploys CloudNativePG 1.28.4 and
contains downstream RBAC and CRD patches. Give the package an immutable
downstream version and keep the upstream version discoverable in metadata.
---
diff --git a/cloudnative-pg/Chart.yaml b/cloudnative-pg/Chart.yaml
--- a/cloudnative-pg/Chart.yaml
+++ b/cloudnative-pg/Chart.yaml
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 apiVersion: v2
-appVersion: 1.28.1
+appVersion: 1.28.4
 dependencies:
 - alias: monitoring
   condition: monitoring.grafanaDashboard.create
@@ -22,4 +22,6 @@ name: cloudnative-pg
 sources:
 - https://github.com/cloudnative-pg/charts
 type: application
-version: 0.27.1
+annotations:
+  charts.vexxhost.com/upstream-version: 0.27.1
+version: 0.27.1-vexxhost.1
diff --git a/cloudnative-pg/README.md b/cloudnative-pg/README.md
--- a/cloudnative-pg/README.md
+++ b/cloudnative-pg/README.md
@@ -1,9 +1,14 @@
 # cloudnative-pg
 
-![Version: 0.27.1](https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-0.27.1-informational?style=flat-square) ![Type: application](https://img.shields.io/badge/Type-application-informational?style=flat-square) ![AppVersion: 1.28.1](https://img.shields.io/badge/AppVersion-1.28.1-informational?style=flat-square)
+![Version: 0.27.1-vexxhost.1](https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-0.27.1--vexxhost.1-informational?style=flat-square) ![Type: application](https://img.shields.io/badge/Type-application-informational?style=flat-square) ![AppVersion: 1.28.4](https://img.shields.io/badge/AppVersion-1.28.4-informational?style=flat-square)
 
 CloudNativePG Operator Helm Chart
 
+This is a VEXXHOST-maintained variant of upstream chart 0.27.1 with the
+CloudNativePG 1.28.4 CRDs and required EndpointSlice permissions.
+It is maintained for Atmosphere compatibility; Kubernetes 1.28 is outside
+the versions supported upstream by CloudNativePG 1.28.
+
 **Homepage:** <https://cloudnative-pg.io>
 
